/**
 * Georgian text for billing: invoice titles, notes, void and dispute reasons,
 * line descriptions (generated by `domain/billing.ts` and the ad-hoc seed),
 * invoice template names and block texts and outbox subjects. The points-ledger
 * notes and project names live in `work.ts` (they are seeded with the tasks).
 *
 * Vocabulary follows the UI chrome and the invoice document labels
 * (`DOC_LABELS.ka`): ინვოისი, გადახდა, მონახაზი, ქულა, პოზიცია, დღგ.
 */
